---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Deeper Global | Trusted Mental Health Intelligence"
  description="Learn about Deeper Global's mission to make trusted mental health answers more accessible."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <main class="content">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Deeper Global helps people find clear, trustworthy answers to mental health questions.</h1>
    <p class="summary">
      Our goal is simple: make it easier to understand what you may be feeling, what it might mean, and what kinds of support could help.
    </p>

    <h2>What We're Building</h2>
    <p>
      Deeper Global is a mental health resource built around real questions people ask when they are stressed, overwhelmed, uncertain, or trying to understand themselves better.
    </p>
    <p>
      We organize answers by topic so you can explore related concerns, learn at your own pace, and find language for what you may be experiencing.
    </p>

    <h2>Why Trust Comes First</h2>
    <p>
      Mental health information should be handled carefully.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our content is designed to be clear, grounded, and responsible. We aim to distinguish education from diagnosis, include crisis guidance when needed, and protect the privacy of people looking for help.
    </p>

    <h2>Where We're Going</h2>
    <p>
      Over time, Deeper Global can help connect people with better resources, including therapists, treatment options, and trusted support.
    </p>
    <p>
      But the foundation will stay the same: helping people feel more informed, less alone, and better prepared to take the next step.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
